<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="t00843">
	<title>Front wiper blade replacement</title>
	<taskbody>
		<context id="e04955">
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04956">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e04957">
									<image href="images/N_SP3i26_B12_005_1_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>To replace the wiper blade, lift the arm first and replace the windshield wiper blades as per procedure.</p>
			<note type="note" id="e04958">
				<p>Wiper arms</p>
				<p>Do not allow the wiper arm to fall against the windshield, as it may crack or chip the glass.</p>
			</note>
		</context>
		<steps id="e04959">
			<step>
				<cmd>Raise the wiper arm.</cmd>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>For Type A, lift up the wiper blade clip. Then pull down the blade assembly and remove it.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04960">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04961">
											<title>Type A</title>
											<image href="images/N_SP3i26_B12_006_1_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>For Type B, rotate the wiper blade in the direction of the arrow.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04962">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04963">
											<title>Type B</title>
											<image href="images/N_SP3i26_B12_090_I.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>For Type A, install the new blade assembly.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04964">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04965">
											<title>Type A</title>
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP3i26_B12_007_E.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>For Type B, remove the front wiper blade by pressing the lock pin in the direction of the arrow.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e04966">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e04967">
											<title>Type B</title>
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP3i26_B12_091_I.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e04968">
											<title>Type B</title>
											<image align="center" placement="break" scale="95" href="images/N_SP3i26_B12_092_I.jpg"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Make sure that both blade assemblies are installed firmly by trying to pull them slightly.</cmd>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Return the wiper arms to the windshield.</cmd>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Start the vehicle to the <term translate="no">ON</term> position to return the wiper arms to their normal operating position.</cmd>
			</step>
		</steps>
	</taskbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00842.dita#t00842" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Blade replacement</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</task>